<title>UK: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the English</p>
<p>premier league after Sunday's match:</p>
<p>20 - Alan Shearer (Newcastle)</p>
<p>18 - Ian Wright (Arsenal)</p>
<p>16 - Robbie Fowler (Liverpool)</p>
<p>15 - Dwight Yorke (Aston Villa)</p>
<p>14 - Fabrizio Ravanelli (Middlesbrough)</p>
<p>13 - Les Ferdinand (Newcastle), Ole Gunnar Solskjaer</p>
<p>(Manchester United)</p>
<p>12 - Matthew Le Tissier (Southampton)</p>
<p>11 - Efan Ekoku (Wimbledon), Steve Claridge (Leicester)</p>
<p>Chris Sutton (Blackburn)</p>
